# Tech contract

The stack/library/framework decisions for this project, authored by **humans**.
This file is **law**: any technology not listed below is an **open decision** —
the agent proposes options and asks before adopting. `csdd graph analyze` indexes
the Decided table and diffs it against declared dependencies, reporting undeclared
usage, phantom entries, and unrefined rows.

Manage it with the `stack` skill (Propose / Refine / Reconcile). Do not prefill
technology choices you have not decided — the structure is provided; the decisions
are yours.

